WEBVTT

00:01:57.585 --> 00:02:00.375
so that it doesn't matter 
where you physically are,

00:02:00.375 --> 00:02:03.295
you can really be there
any place you want to.

00:02:04.305 --> 00:02:08.485
SRK: Sundar, you will excuse me, sometimes
I may just say a few things in Hindi here

00:02:08.485 --> 00:02:09.945
for the audience at home.

00:02:09.945 --> 00:02:13.055
Sundar Pichai is 13000 km away from us

00:02:13.085 --> 00:02:16.255
and he can see us without lag

00:02:16.255 --> 00:02:18.925
He can see you, you can see him

00:02:18.925 --> 00:02:22.865
through this technology called Beam,
this is the future.

00:02:22.865 --> 00:02:25.115
This is a sign of the times to come.

00:02:25.115 --> 00:02:26.575
I would like to ask Sundar,

00:02:26.575 --> 00:02:28.065
Sundar, what are the chances--

00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:31.955
how long before we can actually 
teleport you through a device like this,